    <string name="about_software">About</string>
    <string name="about_back">← Back</string>
    <string name="about_credits_title">Credits &amp; Origins</string>
    <string name="about_credits_desc">ColdTs Client is a free, lightweight TeamSpeak 3/6 client for Android built with Jetpack Compose. It is based on the open-source TS6_Droid project by flammedev (Grégory D) and its community derivatives, driven by the Rust tslib engine.</string>
    <string name="about_enhancement_title">About this fork</string>
    <string name="about_enhancement_desc">This build rebrands the client as ColdTs Client with a full English/Persian localization that follows the phone language, an icy blue Material 3 theme, client/channel/server info dialogs and other classic TeamSpeak features on top of the original project.</string>
    <string name="about_license_title">Open Source License (GPLv3)</string>
    <string name="about_license_desc">This project is licensed under the GNU GPLv3 open-source license. Anyone who modifies or redistributes this project MUST keep it fully open-source under GPLv3 and retain the attribution of the original authors. Closed-source redistribution is strictly prohibited.</string>
    <string name="about_repo_title">Source Repository &amp; Updates</string>
    <string name="about_repo_desc">Source code, releases and issue tracking are published on GitHub. Feel free to star, follow, report issues or submit pull requests:</string>
    <string name="about_repo_link">🔗 Visit the ColdTs Client GitHub repository</string>
    <string name="about_warning_title">⚠️ Scam Warning</string>
    <string name="about_warning_desc">This app is a free, non-profit, open-source project. It is completely FREE and OPEN-SOURCE! Any paid distribution is a scam — if you paid for this software, request a refund immediately and report the seller.</string>
